      "updated": 1741141991195,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Our rocketry system communicates over half duplex LoRa\nradio. All systems manage floor control (who is writing to\nour frequency) by acknowledging their current position in\nthe sequence diagram. See refference",
